# Release, handoff, and README SOP (InPmnt)

**Always ship without asking.** When you finish a connected set of changes that affects **runnable app behavior**, **billing**, **packaging**, or **README download docs** — or the user asks for a shipping build / release / hotfix — do the full pipeline below. Do **not** end with “want me to commit/release?”

## Git (required)

1. `git status` — skip secrets (`.env`, `*.db`, `.venv/`).
2. Commit source + `build_release.ps1` + README + release notes as needed.
3. `git push` to `main`. Diagnose push failures; do not end with “you should push.”

## Builds + GitHub Release (required)

A zip is **not shipped** until it is a GitHub Release asset with a public `releases/download/` URL. Never leave the user with only a local `installers\` path.

1. `powershell -File .\build_release.ps1 <version>` (or `python3 build_release.py` on Linux).
2. Produce **all four** zips under `installers\` with the version **at the end** of the filename:
   - `InPmnt-PHP.vX.Y.Z.zip` — Hostinger / `public_html` drop
   - `InPmnt-Portable.vX.Y.Z.zip` — runnable Windows app (use `start.ps1`)
   - `InPmnt-Source.vX.Y.Z.zip` — source distribution
   - `InPmnt-Icon.vX.Y.Z.zip` — brand icon assets
3. Create the next tag (`vX.Y.Z`) and **GitHub Release**, uploading **all four** assets.
   - Prefer `gh release create vX.Y.Z installers/InPmnt-*.vX.Y.Z.zip --title "InPmnt X.Y.Z"`.
   - If `gh` cannot create the release, **push the tag** (`git tag vX.Y.Z && git push origin vX.Y.Z`) so `.github/workflows/release.yml` publishes the zips.
4. Update README Downloads with verbatim HTTPS links for the same tag and filenames.
5. Commit and push the README if links changed.

## Chat handoff — **### New build links**

| Line | Content |
|------|---------|
| **PHP** | Full URL to `InPmnt-PHP.vX.Y.Z.zip` |
| **Portable** | Full URL to `InPmnt-Portable.vX.Y.Z.zip` |
| **Source** | Full URL to `InPmnt-Source.vX.Y.Z.zip` |
| **Icon** | Full URL to `InPmnt-Icon.vX.Y.Z.zip` |
| **Release page** | `https://github.com/devildog5x5/InPmnt/releases/tag/{tag}` |
| **Local smoke** | `http://127.0.0.1:5055` after `.\start.ps1` |

Never invent `releases/download/...` URLs — verify with `gh release view` after upload.
Never ship unversioned zip names (`InPmnt-PHP.zip`).
